# variation 1 of b08: panic ends the application: the finalize of the primary aspect does not run (D-133)
** spec: semantics/aspects.md#what-an-aspect-is
primary aspect b08_test1 is
  process main is
    apply crash();
    print "never";
  finalize
    print "finalize: never";
  return;
end b08_test1;
